<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυγμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chilliness, dampness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				127.5
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cold fit of an ague,</i> or <i>rigor</i> caused by poison, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.24.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.519
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.186
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχμός.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dryingplace,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαγηνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ez.</u>
					26.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. ἁλιέων</span> Pap. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				40.548
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. γναφέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					86.45
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ψυγμὸν ἐργάταις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.332.27
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ συμψήσαντι τὸν ψυγμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					2p.110
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ὃν ἔχομεν ἐν τῷ ψυγμῷ σὺν
					τῷ ἀχύρῳ κνῆκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRyl.</u>
					69.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>refreshment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔψυξαν ἑαυτοὺν ψυγμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					11.32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
